+
+        // A timestamp discontinuity (e.g. HLS EXT-X-DISCONTINUITY) between
+        // these two frames is not a frame duration. handle_new_frame() treats
+        // the same jump as a discontinuity; use the same tolerance here and
+        // fall back to the nominal duration. Otherwise the last frame before
